// route is "master" (ADMIN only). tests/integration/adminRouteWalk.test.ts compares this list with the
// routes the router really registers, so a route added to admin.ts fails that test until it is listed
// here, on purpose, as staff or master. Keys are "METHOD path" exactly as Express registers them.

